[E0465] Error: `count` is a value, which an `assert` in a signature cannot read
   ╭─[ err/617_an_assert_in_a_signature_where_it_cannot_be/main.wip:8:9 ]
   │
 8 │     assert(count > 0) = count
   │            ──┬──
   │              ╰──── known only when the call runs
   │
   │ Note: a signature's `assert` is checked while the program is compiled, for each instance a call makes: it reads the type and length parameters, constants, and what runs while compiling
